317|40|0|0|0|0|60|0|0|0|0|40|0|0|0|0|39|Did you create the Alephs?|Yes.,Unbelievable, isn't it? I'm such a dunce. I was studying the summoning technique, you know summoning up spirits and such. Those kinds of spirits vanish within minutes. I don't know what went wrong, but they won't disappear. They don't! ,What's more, they continue to multiply. The hunters are hunting them down, but they are multiplying twofold annually. According to my calculations, after ten years, Shiltz will be replete with Alephs. ,That's why I'm studying wizardry even though I hate it. We have to find a way to get rid of them again. When no one is able to control them anymore, I have to be the one to do it. ,I'm scared that I may have to bear the cross someday, that death may be my only way for me to repay. ,Thanks for your help. I can't rest assured since I have someone like you by my side. I'll do whatever I can to help you from now on. I mean it.|1638|0|0|0|0|0|0|31|0|105750|2000|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|1|
